    <briefdescription>
<para><ref refid="classanonymous__namespace_02_g_c_root_lowering_8cpp_03_1_1_g_c_machine_code_analysis" kindref="compound">GCMachineCodeAnalysis</ref> - This is a target-independent pass over the machine function representation to identify safe points for the garbage collector in the machine code. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>It inserts labels at safe points and populates a GCMetadata record for each function. </para>
